# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: `main` is served publicly by GitHub Pages.
# Every committed file is downloadable at savioabraham-pixel.github.io/Bella/<path>.
# Only the deployable site belongs on this branch: index.html, README.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

.claude/
.DS_Store

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets. Real credentials live outside the repo in ~/Bella-Secrets/.
# These patterns are a backstop, not the primary control.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
client_secret*.json
gen-lang-client*.json
service-account*.json
*credentials*.json
token.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project archive — reference material, not part of the deployed site.
# Kept on disk, deliberately out of git so it is never published.
# Directory names use underscores, not spaces: a trailing space in a name is
# stripped from an ignore pattern unless escaped, which fails silently.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
BKC/
Bella_App/
Bella_Icons/
Bella_Testing/
Bella-2/
Favicon/
Feedback_Screenshots/
Index.js-Files.js/
SOW_&_Build_Guides/

# Internal documents (SOW, handover notes, architecture, directives).
# Confidential-by-default: a public Pages branch is not the place for them.
*.docx
~$*

# Project instructions for Claude Code — local to this machine by request.
CLAUDE.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build artifacts and caches.
# The real apps/ source lives on the beta branch; what lands here on main is
# only leftover build output from switching branches. Patterns are scoped to
# artifacts rather than ignoring apps/ wholesale, so genuine source under
# apps/ is never silently skipped.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
